WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Ryu guards the delayed standing heavy kick.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.700
JP changes from the guarded strike to a normal throw.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.200
The existing portal supplies its automatic strike during the throw.

4
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.150
Ryu falls after the strike-throw branch.
